14px">351</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（三）评比。联合组织专家进行评比。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">四、报送要求</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（一）越思政金课</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集形式：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">“金课”统一主题，自拟题目，用好“总书记在绍兴的足迹”相关资源。可采用研学式、融合式、主题式、议题式等教学形式，避免教师单纯的讲授，突出学生的主体作用。每个教学视频时长</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分钟以内，采用</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">MP4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">格式，要求图像清晰稳定、构图合理、声音清楚，主要教学环节有字幕提示。参与教师必须同时提供一份与“金课”一致的教学设计，含学情分析、重难点、教学目标、教学方法与过程、教学反思等，字数</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">3000</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字左右。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集对象：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">思政课专任、兼职教师，思政辅导员，党、团、队干部和辅导员。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集截止时间：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">0</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（二）课程思政</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集形式：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课程思政案例以文字材料为主，每篇</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">3000</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字左右。课程思政案例主要有教学设计、课堂片段实录、案例分析等构成（见附件</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）。 </span><span style="font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集对象：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">所有学科教师。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集截止时间：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">0</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（三）大思政育人品牌</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集形式：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以案例的形式呈现；案例的配套视频时长为</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">3-5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分钟；案例突出学校思政育人的整体构建、创新亮点、典型经验、优秀成果，梳理总结相关机制体制、思路方法、工作举措、特色载体、成果成效等，每篇可以插入运行流程图、思维导图等不超过</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">张，每篇不超过</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">4000</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字。案例的格式如下：</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></p><table><tbody><tr style="height:30px" class="firstRow"><td width="193" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">项</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">目</span></span></p></td><td width="403" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">要</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">求</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td width="193" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">案例题目</span></span></p></td><td width="403" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">简洁凝练，中心突出，富有特色</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td width="193" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">案例背景</span></span></p></td><td width="403" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">时代背景、地域特色、学情分析（学段衔接）</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td width="193" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">案例目标</span></span></p></td><td width="403" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">达成的思政一体化目标</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td width="193" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">案例设计与</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">实施过程</span></span></p></td><td width="403" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学校思政一体化育人的整体设计、落实举措与组织实施、整体推进</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td width="193" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">案例分析</span></span></p></td><td width="403" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">理论依据、创新做法、特色亮点、结果成效</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td width="193" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">案例反思</span></span></p></td><td width="403" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">目标达成度，启示，进一步改进策略</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集对象：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">大中小幼职学校</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集截止时间：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">0</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（四）</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“我眼中的中国式现代化”研学成果</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集形式：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以调研报告、专题采访的形式呈现研学成果。学生成果报告由题目、摘要、关键词、正文、附件等部分构成。其中正文包含背景（或起因）与意义、目标与活动设计、活动过程描述、结论与分析四个部分。总字数在</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">3000</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字以内，图片不超过</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">张。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集对象：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">所有学生和指导教师。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集截止时间：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">9</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">月</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">30</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">日。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">五、其他</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．征集的案例纸质稿及电子稿由各区、县（市）教研部门和高校党委宣传部统一上报（纸质稿一式一份），不接受个人申报。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．绍兴市思政课一体化建设联盟学校可在大思政一体化育人品牌、课程思政教学案例和研学成果评比中选报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">项。绍兴市思政课一体化名师工作室联盟成员可在“越思政金课”和研学成果评比中选报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">项。上述申报不占各区、县（市）分配名额。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．联系人：中小学幼儿职教，骆新华、陈雅琴老师（钉钉）；高校、思政课一体化联盟学校和名师工作室，绍兴文理学院马克思主义学院肖海岳、沈勇老师（浙政钉）。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．绍兴市教育教学研究院</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">号文件中关于中小学课程思政案例、思政教育一体化（含越思政金课、大思政育人品牌）案例和</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学生学习活动成果评审文件中关于“我眼中的中国式现代化”研学成果征集等相关评审结果由我院统一公布。评比活动结束后将择优作展示、交流等活动。</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">附件：</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．第三届“越思政金课”推荐汇总表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503060830472959.docx" title="202503060830472959.docx">202503060830472959.docx</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span>
</p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．第五届课程思政一体化案例推荐申报表、汇总表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503060830561061.docx" title="202503060830561061.docx">202503060830561061.docx</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span>
</p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．第二届大思政育人品牌推荐汇总表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503060831047478.docx" title="202503060831047478.docx">202503060831047478.docx</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span>
</p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．第二届“我眼中的中国式现代化”一体化研学成果推荐汇总表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503060831128041.docx" title="202503060831128041.docx">202503060831128041.docx</a></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span>
</p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
